3187
03:28:47,920 --> 03:28:48,680
What?

3188
03:28:49,340 --> 03:28:49,920
What?

3189
03:28:50,300 --> 03:28:50,380
What?

3190
03:28:50,800 --> 03:28:50,800
What?

3191
03:28:51,420 --> 03:28:52,240
Wait, where?

3192
03:28:52,400 --> 03:28:52,560
How?

3193
03:28:56,280 --> 03:28:57,040
What?

3194
03:28:57,260 --> 03:28:58,220
This thing has RCS?

3195
03:29:02,400 --> 03:29:03,360
