3201
03:29:31,200 --> 03:29:31,680
124.

3202
03:29:32,160 --> 03:29:33,000
We're taking that!

3203
03:29:33,160 --> 03:29:33,620
We're taking it!

3204
03:29:36,720 --> 03:29:37,640
Not bad!

3205
03:29:43,220 --> 03:29:47,440
Now, when we get here... Oh, it's 400!

3206
