3251
03:32:39,700 --> 03:32:43,900
Oh, wait, it's because... There we go.

3252
03:32:44,320 --> 03:32:44,940
Oh, much better.

3253
03:32:46,080 --> 03:32:46,520
Okay.

3254
03:32:47,780 --> 03:32:50,040
We have 1200 delta V on this one, man.

3255
03:32:50,860 --> 03:32:52,200
That's... It ain't great.

3256
03:32:58,250 --> 03:33:01,730
You know, actually, just point it retro, it's gonna figure it out on its own, right?

3257
03:33:02,810 --> 03:33:03,870
I can just chill now.

3258
03:33:05,330 --> 03:33:06,110
Yo, look at that over there!

3259
03:33:06,230 --> 03:33:07,870
What the hell is going on on this planet?

3260
03:33:09,290 --> 03:33:10,590
Ha, polar ice caps?

3261
03:33:12,170 --> 03:33:12,570
Sweet.

3262
03:33:16,710 --> 03:33:18,470
Yo, man, the Duna looks awesome.

3263
03:33:19,250 --> 03:33:19,910
Big fan.

3264
03:33:22,350 --> 03:33:23,970
Okay, 20 seconds until burn.

3265
03:33:31,350 --> 03:33:32,950
Slow the hell down, brother.

3266
03:33:35,050 --> 03:33:38,050
We actually have Kerbals around Duna right now.

3267
03:33:41,690 --> 03:33:42,850
How nuts is that?

3268
03:33:43,050 --> 03:33:44,650
We are officially in orbit as well.

3269
03:34:00,120 --> 03:34:00,480
Okay.

3270
03:34:00,480 --> 03:34:02,220
Well, here's the plan.

3271
03:34:03,300 --> 03:34:05,260
We're gonna go straight down on the surface right now.

3272
03:34:07,680 --> 03:34:12,660
With this stage, we're gonna use this stage as much as we can all the way down, and then we're gonna get rid of it.

3273
03:34:14,440 --> 03:34:16,380
We do not click this button to get rid of it.

3274
03:34:19,080 --> 03:34:20,560
Because this one is not gonna stay in orbit.

3275
03:34:20,840 --> 03:34:21,540
Let's be honest.

3276
03:34:23,160 --> 03:34:24,320
Actually, is this a smart idea?

3277
03:34:25,780 --> 03:34:27,120
There's people on board.

3278
03:34:29,460 --> 03:34:32,180
Actually, we... hold on, we can't do that.

3279
03:34:33,240 --> 03:34:34,020
That's bad.

3280
03:34:34,580 --> 03:34:37,660
But what I can do... Nah, wait, that doesn't make sense.

3281
03:34:43,760 --> 03:34:45,840
I want to detach... Oh, I have an idea.

3282
03:34:45,920 --> 03:34:46,180
I have an idea.

3283
03:34:48,200 --> 03:34:48,900
Watch this.

3284
03:34:51,200 --> 03:34:51,960
Wait, hold on.

3285
03:34:52,080 --> 03:34:52,800
I need to think this through.

3286
03:34:54,360 --> 03:35:04,440
So we go... And then... This guy... Move... Yeah.

3287
03:35:04,840 --> 03:35:05,000
Yep.

3288
03:35:05,540 --> 03:35:05,800
Yep.

3289
03:35:06,060 --> 03:35:06,340
You ready?

3290
03:35:06,740 --> 03:35:07,100
Here we go.

3291
03:35:10,580 --> 03:35:11,660
How do I... Undock.

3292
03:35:14,280 --> 03:35:15,180
One duck.

3293
03:35:17,340 --> 03:35:18,540
Stop turning!

3294
03:35:18,880 --> 03:35:19,700
Why did you turn?

3295
03:35:20,100 --> 03:35:21,940
You absolute buffoon!

3296
03:35:23,540 --> 03:35:25,580
I was counting on you staying put.

3297
03:35:28,580 --> 03:35:29,500
Turn back.

3298
03:35:33,360 --> 03:35:34,880
No, don't duck!

3299
03:35:38,340 --> 03:35:40,360
No, they're gonna duck again.

3300
03:35:44,590 --> 03:35:45,490
Wait, what?

3301
03:35:45,810 --> 03:35:49,090
Oh no, now this... Not this again.

3302
03:35:49,450 --> 03:35:51,830
Why did you turn, you fucking idiot?

3303
03:35:57,390 --> 03:35:58,110
Pain.

3304
03:36:00,050 --> 03:36:01,210
Maybe it's okay.

3305
03:36:03,290 --> 03:36:03,970
Undock.

3306
03:36:04,690 --> 03:36:05,550
Bye-bye.

3307
03:36:12,380 --> 03:36:14,120
Just let it get safely away.

3308
03:36:14,440 --> 03:36:15,440
You are now orbiting?

3309
03:36:16,360 --> 03:36:17,140
Good luck.

3310
03:36:17,440 --> 03:36:17,680
Okay.

3311
03:36:18,220 --> 03:36:19,760
We gotta talk with this again now.

3312
03:36:49,610 --> 03:36:51,070
Yes, actually it's perfect.

3313
03:36:53,210 --> 03:36:54,590
From one to the other.

3314
03:37:44,180 --> 03:37:45,620
I will not have any mistakes.

3315
03:37:45,780 --> 03:37:46,260
Not this time.

3316
03:37:47,760 --> 03:37:48,880
Not this time.

3317
03:37:51,760 --> 03:37:53,040
This is gonna be a first timer.

3318
03:38:43,930 --> 03:38:45,210
Beautiful.

3319
03:38:45,570 --> 03:38:46,530
Alright.

3320
03:38:47,470 --> 03:38:48,170
Alright.

3321
03:38:49,090 --> 03:38:49,910
Shut down engine.

3322
03:38:51,490 --> 03:38:53,330
Shut down... Activate.

3323
03:38:57,540 --> 03:38:59,880
Damn, that sounded like something just broke.

3324
03:39:00,200 --> 03:39:01,800
I'm hoping that's not the case.

3325
03:39:03,300 --> 03:39:04,260
We'll have to see.

3326
03:39:05,880 --> 03:39:09,680
Now, you guys... Are we chilling here?

3327
03:39:10,320 --> 03:39:13,260
Bob, Elodin, engineer, scientist.

3328
03:39:14,400 --> 03:39:18,200
On the other one, we have Jebediah and Edrim, engineer and pilot.

3329
03:39:19,940 --> 03:39:21,360
Yep, yep, yep.

3330
03:39:24,100 --> 03:39:27,960
We're gonna take another lap around this planet before we land.

3331
03:39:28,280 --> 03:39:28,980
Whoa, is that the shadow?

3332
03:39:29,060 --> 03:39:29,900
Oh, look at that!

3333
03:39:30,560 --> 03:39:31,580
That's what that was!

3334
03:39:31,700 --> 03:39:32,820
It was a shadow from Ike?

3335
03:39:34,140 --> 03:39:34,580
Damn!

3336
03:39:36,540 --> 03:39:37,320
That's cool.

3337
03:39:41,940 --> 03:39:43,340
Let's get all the way around here.

3338
03:39:45,800 --> 03:39:47,960
We also have a relay there, which is awesome.

3339
03:39:48,760 --> 03:39:51,760
This is where the rover is on the dark side.

3340
03:39:56,720 --> 03:40:01,540
Ideally, I think I want to come in... not super steep.

3341
03:40:02,680 --> 03:40:06,660
I want to slow down in the atmosphere, but not to the extent where I'm burning up, you know?

3342
03:40:08,660 --> 03:40:09,940
So here's what we're going to do.

3343
03:40:11,800 --> 03:40:13,040
We're going to face Retro.

3344
03:40:15,560 --> 03:40:16,860
Wait, wait, stop, stop, stop, stop.

3345
03:40:18,360 --> 03:40:19,120
Is that correct?

3346
03:40:19,380 --> 03:40:20,600
Are we doing...

3347
03:40:30,370 --> 03:40:32,310
Maybe I have to say inverse then?

3348
03:40:36,580 --> 03:40:37,900
Yes, yes, yes.

3349
03:40:38,900 --> 03:40:39,300
Retrograde?

3350
03:40:40,080 --> 03:40:41,240
Yeah, that looks more correct.

3351
03:40:41,340 --> 03:40:42,000
It's pointing that way now.

3352
03:40:44,200 --> 03:40:45,000
Oh my god.

3353
03:40:46,260 --> 03:40:47,600
Guys, are you ready for this?

3354
03:40:48,400 --> 03:40:49,400
It's about to happen.

3355
03:40:51,300 --> 03:40:53,880
Yo, look at that valley down there.

3356
03:40:53,980 --> 03:40:54,920
Valles Marineris.

3357
03:40:56,480 --> 03:40:57,300
Looks really cool.

3358
03:41:06,420 --> 03:41:07,780
It's a thin atmosphere.

3359
03:41:11,000 --> 03:41:12,700
We can probably get away with a lot.

3360
03:41:17,280 --> 03:41:18,240
There we go.

3361
03:41:31,720 --> 03:41:32,360
Okay.

3362
03:41:32,840 --> 03:41:34,780
I'm gonna burn... not yet.

3363
03:41:38,450 --> 03:41:39,770
Or should I just go full out?

3364
03:41:41,610 --> 03:41:42,470
Drop straight down.

3365
03:41:49,470 --> 03:41:50,270
Wait a little bit.

3366
03:42:03,010 --> 03:42:05,310
It's gonna take a while for this to reorient itself, that's annoying.

3367
03:42:09,330 --> 03:42:10,750
Electric charge, we're charging.

3368
03:42:11,730 --> 03:42:14,010
We do have solar panels on the side here, let's not forget.

3369
03:42:30,010 --> 03:42:31,290
Yes, yes, yes, yes.

3370
03:42:34,100 --> 03:42:35,400
Gonna burn more now.

3371
03:42:35,820 --> 03:42:36,940
Align yourself, come on.

3372
03:42:38,980 --> 03:42:40,220
Look at that over there!

3373
03:42:40,580 --> 03:42:42,900
Looks like a freaking sandstorm front.

3374
03:42:44,460 --> 03:42:48,300
Dude, I wanna make a buggy or something and drive through it like Mad Max.

3375
03:42:49,720 --> 03:42:50,700
Witness me!

3376
03:42:53,600 --> 03:42:54,740
That looks awesome.

3377
03:42:58,460 --> 03:43:00,920
Kind of a steep angle here, but that's by design.

3378
03:43:03,300 --> 03:43:04,620
I'm gonna wait a little here.

3379
03:43:10,340 --> 03:43:12,080
And... burn the remaining 300.

3380
03:43:14,900 --> 03:43:16,100
Slow the fuck down.

3381
03:43:22,700 --> 03:43:23,540
Okay, goodbye.

3382
03:43:24,260 --> 03:43:25,220
It was nice knowing you.

3383
03:43:27,660 --> 03:43:31,440
Okay, with this guy now... Control point.

3384
03:43:31,740 --> 03:43:32,160
Default.

3385
03:43:32,600 --> 03:43:33,240
Turn around.

3386
03:43:38,000 --> 03:43:38,420
Yep.

3387
03:43:39,120 --> 03:43:40,680
Maybe we want to get out of the way a little bit here.

3388
03:43:42,740 --> 03:43:43,160
Actually.

3389
03:43:46,020 --> 03:43:47,040
Get out of the way slightly.

3390
03:43:48,840 --> 03:43:49,460
Activate engine.

3391
03:43:53,190 --> 03:43:54,010
There we go.

3392
03:43:54,130 --> 03:43:54,730
There we go.

3393
03:43:55,190 --> 03:43:55,670
Stay clear.

3394
03:43:57,630 --> 03:43:58,110
Okay.

3395
03:43:58,850 --> 03:44:00,070
Now, we do have chutes.

3396
03:44:02,370 --> 03:44:04,330
I could actually deploy them now.

3397
03:44:05,850 --> 03:44:12,430
I'm so scared of hitting this button right here... that I'm not going to click any space bars anymore from now on.

3398
03:44:22,740 --> 03:44:23,820
Oh my god, stop that.

3399
03:44:26,520 --> 03:44:27,260
Oh, Jesus.

3400
03:44:35,700 --> 03:44:36,840
Uh... Are we gonna burn up?

3401
03:44:37,160 --> 03:44:38,240
We're moving very slow, though.

3402
03:44:38,380 --> 03:44:39,160
Like, this is fine, right?

3403
03:44:42,100 --> 03:44:43,920
Maybe I use a little bit of fuel?

3404
03:44:46,040 --> 03:44:47,400
You only have a thousand?

3405
03:44:48,160 --> 03:44:49,180
That can't be right.

3406
03:44:49,600 --> 03:44:50,300
Also, legs.

3407
03:44:50,540 --> 03:44:51,080
Extend.

3408
03:44:53,560 --> 03:44:54,200
Antenna.

3409
03:44:55,940 --> 03:44:56,580
Extend.

3410
03:44:59,300 --> 03:45:00,140
Coming down.

3411
03:45:03,240 --> 03:45:03,880
Activate.

3412
03:45:04,640 --> 03:45:06,340
Oh, there's a limit on it.

3413
03:45:10,220 --> 03:45:12,160
I'm gonna slow down to like 400-ish.

3414
03:45:21,190 --> 03:45:22,250
Okay, uh, shoot.

3415
03:45:24,650 --> 03:45:29,290
Wait, nothing's... Oh, deploy mode when safe.

3416
03:45:30,270 --> 03:45:32,250
Uh, when risky.

3417
03:45:33,990 --> 03:45:34,390
Immediate.

3418
03:45:35,570 --> 03:45:36,850
But it's not working.

3419
03:45:39,410 --> 03:45:40,710
I don't know, I don't know, I don't know, I don't know!

3420
03:45:46,130 --> 03:45:47,650
Antenna broken by... oh shit.

3421
03:45:49,390 --> 03:45:50,710
Slow the fuck down.

3422
03:45:53,170 --> 03:45:53,750
Oh!

3423
03:45:59,150 --> 03:46:00,130
Parachutes, where are you?

3424
03:46:04,730 --> 03:46:05,510
Oh god.

3425
03:46:05,790 --> 03:46:06,350
Slow down!

3426
03:46:07,670 --> 03:46:08,510
Oh shit.

3427
03:46:10,650 --> 03:46:12,590
Parachutes, where the... frick?

3428
03:46:15,760 --> 03:46:17,580
Slow, slow, slow, slow, slow, slow, slow, slow, slow, slow, slow.

3429
03:46:18,660 --> 03:46:19,340
There we go, there we go.

3430
03:46:21,300 --> 03:46:21,880
Slow me down.

3431
03:46:31,940 --> 03:46:33,880
Oh, oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

3432
03:46:36,120 --> 03:46:36,880
Okay, okay, okay.

3433
03:46:39,120 --> 03:46:39,660
We're descending.

3434
03:46:44,250 --> 03:46:45,650
I'm giving it juice on the way down.

3435
03:46:46,770 --> 03:46:48,030
I don't trust like that, you know?

3436
03:46:50,970 --> 03:46:53,510
Dude, it says we have so much fuel, but... Oh.

3437
03:46:54,410 --> 03:46:54,770
Oh!

3438
03:46:56,050 --> 03:46:57,830
I had turned off access to it.

3439
03:47:01,270 --> 03:47:02,430
Why are we wobbling so much?

3440
03:47:02,810 --> 03:47:03,570
Stop wobbling!

3441
03:47:06,530 --> 03:47:07,870
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

3442
03:47:08,370 --> 03:47:09,010
Don't fall over.

3443
03:47:09,550 --> 03:47:10,210
Don't fall over.

3444
03:47:13,320 --> 03:47:13,840
Oh shit.

3445
03:47:14,340 --> 03:47:15,480
It really wants to fall over.

3446
03:47:17,840 --> 03:47:18,460
I'm in trouble.

3447
03:47:19,920 --> 03:47:20,640
Why are any rubble?

3448
03:47:23,140 --> 03:47:24,780
We are not out of the woods yet.

3449
03:47:31,460 --> 03:47:31,820
Fuck.

3450
03:47:37,800 --> 03:47:38,620
Are you gonna stay put?

3451
03:47:46,530 --> 03:47:47,210
Okay, okay.

3452
03:47:48,710 --> 03:47:51,750
Uh... Oh, I don't like that we're actually coming out on this side.

3453
03:47:51,810 --> 03:47:52,830
That's gonna add weight over there.

3454
03:47:54,870 --> 03:47:55,230
Jebediah.

3455
03:47:57,070 --> 03:47:57,730
We safe?

3456
03:48:00,110 --> 03:48:00,790
We're not safe.

3457
03:48:00,790 --> 03:48:01,010
Get in.

3458
03:48:01,530 --> 03:48:02,270
It was tipping over.

3459
03:48:02,650 --> 03:48:03,990
His weight was actually tipping it over.

3460
03:48:04,070 --> 03:48:04,430
I'm not kidding.

3461
03:48:05,030 --> 03:48:05,910
We're gonna have to turn it.

3462
03:48:06,590 --> 03:48:07,230
If we can.

3463
03:48:09,070 --> 03:48:09,690
Reaction wheels.

3464
03:48:15,100 --> 03:48:15,460
Yeah.

3465
03:48:15,460 --> 03:48:17,400
Dude, these reaction reels are crazy strong.

3466
03:48:17,860 --> 03:48:18,420
What the fuck?

3467
03:48:19,900 --> 03:48:21,620
Alright, I mean, alright, there we go, there we go.

3468
03:48:23,840 --> 03:48:25,780
We gotta get the weight out on the other side here.

3469
03:48:29,800 --> 03:48:32,100
And there we go.

3470
03:48:32,280 --> 03:48:32,360
Okay.

3471
03:48:35,100 --> 03:48:35,460
Jebediah?

3472
03:48:38,100 --> 03:48:38,740
Are we good?

3473
03:48:39,720 --> 03:48:40,380
Are we tipping?

3474
03:48:43,180 --> 03:48:44,340
Can you fix parachutes?

3475
03:48:44,580 --> 03:48:44,980
Repack.

3476
03:48:46,200 --> 03:48:48,140
Crew member has insufficient engineer skill level.

3477
03:48:48,240 --> 03:48:49,700
Oh shit, you need an engineer for that?

3478
03:48:50,760 --> 03:48:51,520
I brought one.

3479
03:48:51,680 --> 03:48:52,520
Fucking thank god.

3480
03:48:56,540 --> 03:48:57,660
Oh, yes.

3481
03:48:58,700 --> 03:48:59,540
Boom, baby.

3482
03:49:00,140 --> 03:49:00,800
They're packed.

3483
03:49:01,880 --> 03:49:02,840
Okay, that's good.

3484
03:49:03,700 --> 03:49:05,220
Now, science.

3485
03:49:07,140 --> 03:49:08,000
Science time.

3486
03:49:08,940 --> 03:49:12,040
I'm so scared of this rocket tipping over the... Oh, no.

3487
03:49:15,180 --> 03:49:17,180
Let me just do some science while I'm in here.

3488
03:49:18,040 --> 03:49:19,100
Conduct material study.

3489
03:49:23,550 --> 03:49:25,570
The samples appear to be permanently red.

3490
03:49:25,850 --> 03:49:29,650
You consider sending missions in pink EVA suits to reduce cleaning costs.

3491
03:49:30,250 --> 03:49:30,870
Say what?

3492
03:49:31,450 --> 03:49:32,630
By the way, we're keeping it.

3493
03:49:32,990 --> 03:49:34,370
Because we're coming home with this.

3494
03:49:35,790 --> 03:49:36,730
We're coming home.

3495
03:49:37,050 --> 03:49:37,710
Oh, yeah, baby.

3496
03:49:38,710 --> 03:49:40,370
Oh, I forgot to use this on the way down.

3497
03:49:40,950 --> 03:49:41,550
Oh, no.

3498
03:49:41,730 --> 03:49:42,330
We can use it now.

3499
03:49:43,550 --> 03:49:43,990
Sick.

3500
03:49:45,210 --> 03:49:46,250
Give me all the data.

3501
03:49:47,010 --> 03:49:48,710
There's air here, but not much of it.

3502
03:49:48,870 --> 03:49:48,970
Yeah.

3503
03:49:49,930 --> 03:49:50,610
Seismic data.

3504
03:49:50,810 --> 03:49:50,970
Yep.

3505
03:49:52,520 --> 03:49:54,140
Mystery goo, yup.

3506
03:49:55,120 --> 03:49:56,280
Grab it all.

3507
03:49:56,940 --> 03:49:57,460
Yup.

3508
03:49:58,220 --> 03:49:58,740
And?

3509
03:49:59,140 --> 03:50:00,620
Now we gotta exit.

3510
03:50:02,240 --> 03:50:03,840
Uh, Edrim.

3511
03:50:05,060 --> 03:50:08,460
You are gonna... grab something here.

3512
03:50:09,780 --> 03:50:11,020
Let me see.

3513
03:50:14,900 --> 03:50:16,440
How would I do that?

3514
03:50:17,120 --> 03:50:17,960
Inventory.

3515
03:50:18,820 --> 03:50:20,160
Experiment kit.

3516
03:50:23,500 --> 03:50:24,760
You don't need a parachute right now.

3517
03:50:26,160 --> 03:50:28,480
Question though, if I fall down here, can I get back up?

3518
03:50:30,960 --> 03:50:32,460
It has very low G though, right?

3519
03:50:32,580 --> 03:50:33,400
So it should be okay.

3520
03:50:35,500 --> 03:50:36,640
I'm actually a little scared of that.

3521
03:50:39,280 --> 03:50:42,760
Edrim, you will have to sacrifice your life in case you cannot get back up.

3522
03:50:42,840 --> 03:50:43,280
